"url": "about/changelog.html#-performance",
"text": "reconcile_coordinates is linear rather than quadratic: it scanned every protein and every reference for each gene, calling a regex on each candidate. Indexed by gene name up front, a 4000-gene genome goes from 18.3 s to 0.011 s with identical output over 200 randomised genomes deduplicate: list.count() per element and a full scan per duplicated gene, replaced with a Counter and a single grouping pass"
